# R6 (provisional): `←` rebinds a name, so a whole-tensor `←` into a `mut` tensor parameter is rejected everywhere; write `target ⇇ source`.

fn fill(mut tf32[2, 2] target, tf32[2, 2] source) → void {
    target ← source
}

main {}
